OL,3,ADutch institute issues 'red alert' over
OL,4,ATrump-shaped ecstasy pills
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Dutch drug addiction and mental
OL,7,Fhealth institute has issued a "red
OL,8,Falert" to users about potentially
OL,9,Flethal ecstasy pills in the shape of US
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump's head.
OL,12,FThe Utrecht-based Trimbos Institute
OL,13,Fsaid several of the pills had been
OL,14,Fhanded in at testing centres in August
OL,15,Fand were found to contain a "very high"
OL,16,Famount of the chemical PMMA.
OL,18,F"Do not use this pill under any
OL,19,Fcircumstance," the institute said in
OL,20,Fits warning, cautioning that the drug
OL,21,Fcould cause "overheating with
OL,22,Fpotentially fatal consequences".
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
