OL,3,ADutch institute issues 'red alert' over
OL,4,ATrump-shaped ecstasy pills
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt issued images of the pills, which
OL,7,Ffeature a depiction of Trump's head on
OL,8,Fone side and the words "Trump" and "NL"
OL,9,Fstamped on the other.
